      "previewText": "Answer the following questions for the electrolysis of molten PbCl2 (shown in the diagram below).Which reaction occurs at the anode? Which reaction occurs at the cathode? Determine the minimum voltage that must be applied to a cell containing molten PbCl2 in order for electrolysis to occur. VIf @@amps1@@ A is applied for @@time@@ minutes, what mass of Pb(s) will be produced? g PbIf @@amps2@@ A of current is applied, how long would it take to produce @@mass@@ g of Pb(s)?  hr",
      "targeted": [],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "data": [
            {
              "expression": "// Two variable definitions\nconst amps1 = OLI.random(2.80, 6.50,2) .toFixed(2);\nconst time = OLI.random(65,95,1);\nconst timeS = (time*60);\nconst amps1TimesTime = (amps1*timeS);\nconst moleE = (amps1TimesTime/96485);\nconst massPb = ((moleE/2)*207.2) .toPrecision(3);\nconst massPbLow = massPb*0.98;\nconst massPbHigh = massPb*1.02;\n\nconst amps2 = OLI.random(12.0,18.0,1) .toFixed(1);\nconst mass = OLI.random(18, 55, 1);\nconst molPb= (mass/207.2);\nconst Q = (molPb*2*96485);\nconst divQ = (Q/amps2);\nconst correct = (divQ/3600) .toPrecision(3);\nconst correctLow = (correct*0.98);\nconst correctHigh = (correct*1.02)\n\n\n// Expose variables to OLI\nmodule.exports = {\n amps1,\n time,\n timeS,\n amps1TimesTime,\n moleE,\n massPb,\n massPbLow,\n massPbHigh,\n amps2,\n mass,\n molPb,\n Q,\n divQ,\n correct,\n correctLow,\n correctHigh\n};\n",
              "id": "3237967183",
              "name": "module",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "module"
            }
          ],
          "firstAttemptOnly": false,
          "id": "418144570",
